        "created_at": "2021-06-30T19:37:44.401Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I haven’t seen this posted elsewhere, so I thought I would post it here!</p>\n<p>The “One Shot” podcast is a show in which the host, James D’Amato, plays various RPGs with a rotating collection of guests, some of them frequent and some of them not. They’ve just started their latest game, which is a playthrough of a Sentinels Comics one-shot featured both Christopher Badell and Dave Chalker!</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://oneshotpodcast.com/one-shot/413-sentinel-comics-part-1/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Link is here.</a></p>\n<p>The format for One Shot is generally a single session broken up into anywhere from two to five parts, put out weekly in chunks of around an hour. Characters are introduced, game systems are described as they go, and it’s usually a lot of fun, so I’m looking forward to hearing this unfold.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-06-30T19:37:44.401Z",
