        "created_at": "2021-07-08T15:32:01.137Z",
        "cooked": "<p><a href=\"http://oneshotpodcast.com/one-shot/413-sentinel-comics-part-2/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Part Two is up!</a></p>\n<p>This one is pretty much all one fight scene, as our players get used to how their powers work during the Battle of the Diner. Everyone is doing great, but I’m especially enjoying getting to hear James and Christopher bounce off each other. They are clearly having such a great time.</p>\n<p>It’s also neat to see a battle that’s entirely Lieutenants + Environment. I knew conceptually that you could build a villain team that way, but since most of the one-shots are built with full villains I wasn’t sure how it would play out.</p>",
